The project is structured as a cargo workspace under /bp with several
interrelated crates.

'common' includes shared types and intermediate representations.

'parser' parses the bp language to its intermediate representation.

'document_parser' parses a JSON document to its intermediate
representation.

'json_patch' contains the application of JSON Patch operations to a
parsed JSON document.

'json_merge_patch' contains the application of JSON Merge Patch
operations to a parsed JSON document.

'json_path' contains the application of JSON Path queries to a document
(and the production of documents as a result).

'timeline' includes the generation of a series of events based on the
parsed programs, allowing the display of matches, the tree of documents
produced by the 'json_path' operation (if any), and the result of the
application of a given merge or patch.

'web' contains a server-side rendered exploration of a given program
applied to a given document, visualizing the timeline.
